            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waxay raaceen walaalahoodii gobtoodii ahaa, oo waxay galeen dhaar habaar leh inay ku soconayaan sharciga Ilaah oo loo soo dhiibay Muuse oo ahaa addoonkii Ilaah, iyo inay dhawrayaan oo wada yeelayaan amarrada Rabbiga ah Sayidkeenna, iyo xukummadiisa iyo qaynuunnadiisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo inaynaan gabdhaheenna siinayn dadyowga dalka deggan, oo aynaan gabdhahoodana wiilasheenna u guurinayn; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo haddii dadyowga dalka degganu ay maalinta sabtida keenaan waxyaalo iib ah iyo cunto uun inaynaan iibsanayn maalintii sabtida iyo maalin quduus ah toona; iyo inaan sannadda toddobaad beeraha dayno oo qaan kasta saamaxno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaynu samaysannay amarro inagu xukumaya inaynu sannad kasta sheqel saddexdaloolkiis u bixinayno adeegidda guriga Ilaaheenna, taas oo ah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kibistii tusniinta, iyo qurbaanka hadhuudhka oo joogtada ah, iyo qurbaanka la gubo oo joogtada ah, iyo kan Sabtiyada, iyo kan bilaha cusub, iyo kan iidaha la amray, iyo kan waxyaalaha quduuska ah, iyo qurbaannada dembiga si kafaaraggud loogu sameeyo reer binu Israa'iil, iyo kulli waxa loo sameeyo guriga Ilaah oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo innagoo ah wadaaddada iyo kuwii reer Laawi iyo dadkii kaleba saami baynu u ridannay qurbaanka qoryaha inaynu wakhtigii sannad kasta la amray qoryo gelinayno guriga Ilaaheenna sida qolooyinkeennu yihiin, si qoryaha loogu dul shido meesha allabariga ee Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ah, siday taasu sharciga ugu qoran tahay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo inaynu sannad kasta guriga Rabbiga keenayno midhaha ugu horreeya dhulkeenna iyo midhaha ugu horreeya geedo cayn kasta ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.35"
            ]
